    "Description": "A color photograph taken inside the Pullen Park Carousel house of 3 horses and 1 pig with other animals visible, but too dark to describe. From left to right: a cream pig with a red-trimmed green harness; a brown horse; a cream horse with a white mane and tail that has a red-trimmed pink harness, a green saddle blanket, and a light brown saddle; a brown horse with a black mane and tail that has a red-trimmed blue harness and saddle blanket.\n\nReverse is white with gold text reading \"Kodak-Official Sponsor of the Olympic Games\" with the Olympic rings and \"Kodak Royal Paper.\" Black printed text reads \"<No.10A>515 21+1 NNNNN+29AU 0141.\"",
